data: {"id": "3e1bf13e2278478e-thinking-parallel_evidence-1112", "run_id": "3e1bf13e2278478e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "现在已拿到核心事实：\n\n- **Pod 当前仍存在且确为 Terminating**：`deletionTimestamp=2026-09-03T22:31:03Z`，**`finalizers: [\"aiops.lab/hold\"]`**，`deletionGracePeriodSeconds=0`，`terminationGracePeriodSeconds=10`。\n- **Pod 卡在 Terminating 的直接原因（finalizer 阻塞）**：Pod YAML 中存在自定义 finalizer `aiops.lab/hold`。kubelet 在删除 Pod 时会等待所有 finalizer 被移除后才真正从 API Server 摘除；该 finalizer 未被清理，因此即使 `deletionTimestamp` 早已存在，Pod 对象仍保留且 `phase` 仍显示为 `Running`（但其 `Ready/ContainersReady=False`，容器 `reason=Error exitCode=137`）。\n- **节点健康**：Pod 调度在 `n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1788480251740, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

